# 🎵 Music Catalog & Insights Platform

A full-stack, AI-powered music catalog application that allows users to search across live iTunes catalog data, explore analytical dashboards on music trends, and generate AI-driven catalog insights.

🌐 **Live Demo:** https://music-catalog-insights-psi.vercel.app

---

## 🚀 Tech Stack

### Frontend
- Next.js
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS

### Backend
- Spring Boot (Java)

### Database
- PostgreSQL / MySQL

### AI
- OpenAI API / Spring AI

### Deployment
- Vercel
- Render

---

## ⚠️ Important Status Note

### ✅ Current Implementation State

All core application requirements are fully implemented and operational, including:

- Live Catalog Search
- Debounced Search
- Pagination
- Analytics Dashboard
- AI Features
- Responsive UI
- Production Deployment

### ⚠️ Known Limitation

Adding or saving new albums to the personal library is currently disabled in the production build due to backend database synchronization constraints.

The frontend interface, backend APIs, library browsing, and analytics functionality remain operational.

